     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>I have implemented the method presented on this, <a href=\"http://genome.cshlp.org/content/21/10/1728\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://genome.cshlp.org/content/21/10/1728&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462326201000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3inGj952_6rvqVSGBxsyAM\">Skelly et al 2011</a>, article using STAN. the authors of the article provided R code implementing a Gibbs sampler but it is a bit slow. It takes 25 min on some small simulated example data. The STAN implementation, in here <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/inti/f8b91ee7bcb98288e314\" style=\"font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/inti/f8b91ee7bcb98288e314&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462326201000&amp;usg=AOvVaw174SjUj4_CTlUsyraqhgBH\">https://gist.github.com/inti/f8b91ee7bcb98288e314</a>, is faster and it takes a few mins to produce the same results. I compared the results an they are correct. </div><div>I need to run the model on much larger datasets, orders of magnitud larger. Running on a real sized dataset took a day and it did not finish 100 samples, so it does not look very promising.</div><div><br></div><div>- My question is, how could I speed up the model?</div><div>is it correct to re-write </div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,nimbussansl,liberationsans,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:13px\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">M</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">increment_log_prob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">            log_mix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pi_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                    beta_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">a_hat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">a_hat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  beta_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">e</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d_hat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:top